abstract: >-
  A white paper proposing PVMouse 3.0, a minimum viable biological world model
  starting with C57BL/6J mice. The design connects molecular priors, cell-state
  representations, spatial organs and joint multi-organ dynamics to study
  intervention responses and functional outcomes. The complete system remains
  to be completed and validated.
keywords:
  - biological world model
  - virtual mouse
  - multiscale modeling
  - perturbation prediction
  - spatial transcriptomics
